1" height="22" rx="3" fill="#f5a623"/><text x="339" y="234" font-family="JetBrains Mono, monospace" font-size="12" fill="#ece6d6">5,303</text><text x="20" y="276" font-family="Inter, sans-serif" font-size="12" fill="#6b746c">One scale from 0; higher is better. Refused attempts are retried and not counted.</text></svg></figure>
